# Generate SDKs and artifacts

Run:

```sh
trellis update
trellis generate
```

The project-local output is:

```text
.trellis/
├── apis/       # lock-verified installed dependency artifacts
├── artifacts/  # owned canonical API and participant artifacts
├── rust/       # private generated Rust SDKs and facades
└── ts/         # private generated TypeScript SDKs and participants
```

`trellis generate` is offline. Local dependencies compile from source; registry dependencies use exact installed artifacts from `trellis.lock`. A failed compile leaves the previous successful outputs untouched.
